stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> NavigateToIssues: Open /issues
    NavigateToIssues --> FillForm: Click "Report Issue" & input details
    FillForm --> ValidateInput: Submit form
    
    state check_valid <<choice>>
    ValidateInput --> check_valid
    check_valid --> ShowError: [Form Invalid]
    ShowError --> FillForm: Display toast warning
    
    check_valid --> SaveIssue: [Form Valid]
    SaveIssue --> AssignTechnician: POST /api/issues (Status: 'Open')
    AssignTechnician --> InspectAsset: PUT /api/issues/:id/assign (Status: 'In Progress')
    InspectAsset --> CheckResolved: Field inspection & repair
    
    state check_resolved <<choice>>
    CheckResolved --> check_resolved
    check_resolved --> OrderParts: [Defect Persists]
    OrderParts --> InspectAsset: Log diagnostics & parts
    
    check_resolved --> CloseIssue: [Repair Complete]
    CloseIssue --> UpdateMetrics: PUT /api/issues/:id/status (Status: 'Resolved')
    UpdateMetrics --> [*]: Recalculate asset health & KPI stats
